WEBVTT

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:39.270
At last, we made it into
Valgaav's hideout.

00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:41.940
There we learned from Almayce
what his true objective is:

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:45.410
To destroy Darkstar, the dark
lord from the Overworld.

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:48.410
Hold on! What do you
mean by that?!

00:01:48.820 --> 00:01:52.220
And elsewhere, after stealing
the Sword of Light...

00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:55.150
...Valgaav is about to summon
Darkstar to this world!

00:02:14.180 --> 00:02:14.910
Where are we?

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:28.720
This is where the door will open
upon this world's destruction!

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:31.820
In other words,
where you all will die!

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:49.270
What is this place?

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:51.140
I believe you all have
already seen it.

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:53.920
The light which lies
far away across the sea.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:55.110
This is its source.

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:03.220
This is the
gateway which we built...

00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:06.960
...for when we would
summon Darkstar here.

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:12.370
I... I never imagined such
a thing was built out here.

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:13.370
Xellos!

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:18.470
Because this area is forbidden
to both the Gods and the Monsters.

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:19.800
A forbidden area?

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:22.340
This was where a war
even more ancient...

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:24.400
...than the War of the
Monster's Fall was fought.

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:25.680
You mean!

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:30.380
Exactly. Here was where
Lord Shabranigdo...

00:03:30.450 --> 00:03:34.150
...and the red dragon god
Ceiphied fought each other.

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:04.520
The ancient battleground
of Ceiphied and Shabranigdo...

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:06.990
Well, but...
Why choose this place?

00:04:07.060 --> 00:04:09.860
It was necessary for our plan.

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.460
Hm? For killing Darkstar?

00:04:12.630 --> 00:04:16.430
Exactly. It's true that a gateway
can be opened with just...

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:20.800
...the power of Gorun Nova
and Ragud Mezegis, that lance.

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:24.030
However, that will
only be a small gateway.

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:28.580
This area of space where the
mighty powers of Ceiphied...

00:04:28.650 --> 00:04:32.880
...met those of Shabranigdo
was left permanently destabilized.

00:04:33.720 --> 00:04:36.580
We intended to
utilize this instability...

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:39.890
...to create a gateway
for summoning Darkstar.

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:42.420
I see...
You've planned this well.

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:45.150
Filia!

00:04:45.230 --> 00:04:48.760
And? Why do you need those
other three weapons you mentioned?

00:04:49.270 --> 00:04:52.500
The remaining weapons...
Nezzard and Bodigar...

00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:55.570
Their power will be needed
to close the gateway.

00:04:55.640 --> 00:05:00.300
The hated Darkstar, Dugradigdo,
will then be divided into pieces.

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:03.310
And then the power of Galvayra,
the final weapon...

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:06.280
...will be brought against the pieces
and Darkstar will be destroyed!

00:05:06.550 --> 00:05:10.040
So, if he opens the gateway now,
there'll be no way to close it?!

00:05:15.530 --> 00:05:16.620
Valgaav!

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:21.620
Wouldn't just closing the gate
after summoning Darkstar here...

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:23.860
...have solved things for you guys?

00:05:23.930 --> 00:05:26.630
No. If we simply
closed the gateway...

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:29.610
...he'd devour
this world in no time.

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:31.730
Meaning he could return
to our world again someday.

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:36.170
There were no other options.

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:37.470
In any case...

00:05:42.290 --> 00:05:43.220
Filia!

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:36.230
Don't you find this
wonderfully ironic?

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:41.330
That the power of Ceiphied and
Shabranigdo's battle over this world...

00:06:41.410 --> 00:06:44.070
...will be used to open the
gateway to summon Darkstar here.

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:48.010
A fitting end to this
miserable excuse for a world!

00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:53.480
My name is Filia UI Copt, daughter
of High Priest Bazaard UI Copt...

00:06:53.560 --> 00:06:55.750
...and priestess of
the first Holy Order.

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:58.090
Ah... You're quite an
important person, aren't you?

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:00.830
In the name of Valla Bazaard,
the Fire Dragon King...

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:02.420
...I pass down
judgement upon you!

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:05.630
Abandon your mad desires and
repent your sins! If you don't!

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:10.340
If I don't? Go on and say it,
you naive little girl.

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:18.410
"Anaku soro'mu nazak'u sakriim..."
Chaotic Disintegrate!

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:32.630
I will not be defeated by you.

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:36.520
Not at the bloodstained
hands of a golden dragon.

00:07:42.910 --> 00:07:44.970
Wait! Please tell me!

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:46.740
What you...
What you said to us before...

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:51.250
Did my people really
massacre your race?

00:07:52.050 --> 00:07:54.350
Go home, little girl.

00:07:54.420 --> 00:07:58.220
Please tell me!
Tell me! Please tell me!

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:02.660
ASTRAL BREAK!

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:04.420
ELMEKIA FLAME!

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:07.160
USELESS!

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:10.600
Your attacks will have
no effect at all!

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:12.060
Filia!

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:23.870
I can see there'll be no jokes for
this situation! Besides that...

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:27.180
...without the Sword of Light,
Gourry's pretty much useless.

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:28.120
Sorry...

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:30.650
Not yet! I won't kill you yet!

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:36.220
I'll let you live long enough to see
Darkstar summoned to this world!

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:43.460
Somehow, we have to get
Valgaav away from there.

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:46.130
And then use that chance
to close the gateway!

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:49.930
Easy to say, but can we do that
to Valgaav the way he is now?

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:55.910
Forgive me, but all I've left to
depend on now is you people.

00:08:56.310 --> 00:08:57.970
Miss Lina, let's try our best!

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:00.020
If we give up now,
then the entire world is!

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:02.980
I know. We'll try
whatever we can...

00:09:03.050 --> 00:09:06.350
...and then count on you to
close the gateway in return.

00:09:07.320 --> 00:09:08.690
I understand.

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:15.360
Gods! Monsters! All who live!
Now know how I feel!

00:09:15.870 --> 00:09:18.300
Know my suffering!
Know my anguish!

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:23.400
Gorun Nova, which cleaves!
Ragud Mezegis, which pierces!

00:09:23.470 --> 00:09:25.300
Open the doorway
to the dark star...

00:09:25.380 --> 00:09:27.570
...and let darkness be
brought into this world!

00:09:34.650 --> 00:09:37.380
We're not gonna let you open
the gateway that easily, Valgaav!

00:09:37.850 --> 00:09:39.790
You people just don't
know when to quit.

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:43.620
Unfortunately, if I ran home now,
my big sister would kill me.

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:48.630
Don't make light of me.
Now stand aside!

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:50.830
Nope, can't do that!

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:55.530
He's only released
the energy of Gorun Nova.

00:09:55.610 --> 00:09:56.970
We can still stop him.

00:09:57.610 --> 00:10:00.600
There's still something
only you and I know.

00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:04.110
The reason magic
doesn't work on you.

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:09.950
First, you don't possess astral
bodies like our kind do.

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:15.390
Second, your composition follows
different principles than our world.

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:19.790
Meaning your composition makes
you very fragile in this world.

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:22.320
Am I mistaken?

00:10:48.530 --> 00:10:49.550
Stand aside!

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:52.990
Please stop this! No matter
what may have happened...

00:10:53.070 --> 00:10:55.800
...destroying the world because
of it would be a mistake!

00:10:56.140 --> 00:10:57.400
A mistake?

00:10:57.470 --> 00:11:00.670
Yes. This entire world was
a mistake from the start!

00:11:00.740 --> 00:11:03.140
The Gods, the Monsters,
and everything else!

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:06.470
And mistakes must be
corrected. Shouldn't they?

00:11:08.210 --> 00:11:11.910
It was Lord Gaav who first tried
to correct the mistake!

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:15.440
I'm merely carrying on his will!
By different means, though.

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:21.520
I guess you have no intention
of stopping this, do you?

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:23.560
Just asking me
isn't going to work.

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:26.320
Then you leave me no choice!

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:29.360
BEHFIS BRI NG!

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:33.400
You can't run!

00:11:33.870 --> 00:11:35.810
DI MI L ARWI N!

00:11:48.990 --> 00:11:50.920
We sure put one
over on you, huh?

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:53.650
Now let's settle things here!

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:12.000
Well, were I in your position,
I'd be doing this differently.

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:15.910
Better to just dump
Darkstar on this world.

00:12:16.010 --> 00:12:19.070
We have a code of honor
among the God race.

00:12:19.990 --> 00:12:23.850
How naive.
If you weren't so naive...

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:26.950
...our races might have been able
to negotiate with each other.

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:33.350
I see... Now I finally understand
Lord Beastmaster's feelings...

00:12:33.470 --> 00:12:34.900
BURST FLARE!

00:12:35.070 --> 00:12:36.130
It's useless!

00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:55.580
Dammit! If I only
had a real sword!

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:57.380
Filia!
Gotta borrow something!

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:00.460
What are you doing?!

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:08.590
OW!

00:13:08.770 --> 00:13:10.130
Serves you right!

00:13:10.340 --> 00:13:12.570
With my power as a
dragon combined with...

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:15.000
...the Monster power
I received from Lord Gaav...

00:13:15.070 --> 00:13:17.440
...you people
don't stand a chance!

00:13:21.210 --> 00:13:22.680
Well, I wonder about that.

00:13:23.050 --> 00:13:25.540
If you think that,
feel free to try me out!

00:13:25.920 --> 00:13:29.580
"Lord of Darkness of the Four
Worlds, on thy bonds I do swear."

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:34.320
"Grant me all the power
that you possess!"

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:39.760
I don't know what spell
that was going to be...

00:13:41.230 --> 00:13:43.720
...but too bad it misfired.

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:48.970
Oh, the spell fired off fine.
Perfectly!

00:13:49.270 --> 00:13:50.140
What?!

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:56.010
What are you doing?!

00:13:56.080 --> 00:13:57.240
You're about to see.

00:13:58.050 --> 00:14:02.650
"Darkness beyond twilight,
crimson beyond blood that flows!"

00:14:02.720 --> 00:14:04.190
"Buried in the flow of time..."

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:09.890
"In thy great name...
I pledge myself to darkness."

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:13.090
"Let all the fools who stand
before us be destroyed..."

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:17.260
"...by the power
you and I possess!"

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:19.390
A Dragon Slave!

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:22.140
Yeah, and amplified
for good measure.

00:14:23.580 --> 00:14:28.950
I'm protected by a magical barrier.
You, however, can't neutralize it.

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:30.910
So, how well can you
withstand a Dragon Slave...

00:14:30.980 --> 00:14:32.970
...fired straight
into your body?

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:35.050
DRAGON SLAVE!!!

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:50.690
Did... Did it work?

00:14:51.770 --> 00:14:54.360
There was no way he could
have cast a defense barrier...

00:14:54.440 --> 00:14:56.600
...in the little time I gave him.

00:14:57.940 --> 00:14:59.310
Valgaav...

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:20.060
No... That wasn't
enough to kill him?!

00:15:30.210 --> 00:15:30.870
Filia!

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:36.010
Filia!

00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:47.350
If killing me will appease
your anger, then kill me now!

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:50.190
No. I won't kill you.

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:54.490
You're going to end the
world with your own hand.

00:15:55.230 --> 00:15:58.830
If you do that, you will wipe
away the greatest sin of all!

00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:01.500
Stop it! Stop!

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:06.070
Stop, please!

00:16:06.850 --> 00:16:09.280
Filia! FI LIA!!!

00:16:09.850 --> 00:16:11.440
STOP THIS!!!

00:16:20.630 --> 00:16:26.390
A barrier?! He's activated
Ragud Mezegis as well?!

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:28.060
The gateway...

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:51.990
Filia!

00:16:55.430 --> 00:16:56.520
Look...

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:59.030
The gateway between this
world and the Overworld.

00:17:09.740 --> 00:17:12.370
The gateway of destruction
is now opening!

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:15.610
Let this world
be flooded by darkness!

00:17:18.150 --> 00:17:22.090
Lord Valgaav! LORD VALGAAV!!!

00:17:34.470 --> 00:17:37.960
That's Darkstar? Dugradigdo?!

00:17:49.350 --> 00:17:52.650
Going to devour me first,
you pathetic dark lord?

00:17:53.890 --> 00:17:57.010
Very well, then!
You can have me!

00:18:06.470 --> 00:18:07.330
Valgaav!

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:09.300
LORD VALGAAV!

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:21.100
Just as we feared...
A berserk demon of destruction!

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:24.300
We have no way of
destroying him now.

00:18:33.730 --> 00:18:36.990
Well, there's always
one thing we can try.

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:39.830
Miss Lina?!

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:43.600
Lina's going to try
to cast the Giga Slave!

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:47.570
Miss Lina, no!
Not the Giga Slave!

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:50.610
You know that no human
can control that spell!

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:54.110
You want to stop something
from destroying the world...

00:18:54.180 --> 00:18:57.170
...by casting a spell that may
destroy it anyway, Lina?!

00:18:57.720 --> 00:19:01.240
The Giga Slave... The power of
our mother called to this place!

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:03.980
Stop her...
Please, stop Miss Lina!

00:19:04.690 --> 00:19:06.490
Why won't you do anything?!

00:19:07.630 --> 00:19:08.620
Mr. Almayce!

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:15.430
Even if I cast the
Giga Slave incorrectly...

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:19.030
...the talismans may give me
enough extra strength to control it.

00:19:19.100 --> 00:19:21.070
There's still a chance to win!

00:19:22.310 --> 00:19:26.180
"Darkness beyond blackest pitch,
deeper than the deepest night."

00:19:26.240 --> 00:19:29.510
"King of Darkness, who shines like
gold upon the Sea of Chaos!"

00:19:29.780 --> 00:19:33.380
"I call upon thee!
Swear myself to thee!"

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:35.340
LI NA! DON'T DO IT!!!

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:39.360
"Let the fools who stand
before me be destroyed..."

00:19:42.260 --> 00:19:45.560
"...by the power you and l..."

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:07.180
Look! Our other two weapons,
Nezzard and Bodigar!

00:20:07.490 --> 00:20:09.080
Is there still time?!

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:47.320
Where am I? The others?

00:22:23.520 --> 00:22:25.580
Oh, I don't get this at all!
Where am I?

00:22:25.660 --> 00:22:28.060
Are the others all right?!
What happened?!

00:22:28.130 --> 00:22:29.960
Somebody, ANSWER ME!!!

00:22:30.030 --> 00:22:32.790
Next time, " Disaster and Danger?
This Place is a Wonder Island!"

00:22:32.860 --> 00:22:35.530
You'd better watch, or I'll
REALLY cause some trouble!
